### What to expect:
The script will perform a complex multi-temporal spatial comparison. It will output:
* The exact historical size of the wet zones in Monavale Vlei.
* The exact amount of land that dried up or was paved over between the two periods in Hectares.
* A structured **JSON payload** ready to be plugged into a database or notification gateway.
* A URL visualization showing the **degradation footprint** painted in red over black.

Once you have successfully executed the script, check out the resulting data! You have officially built a fully functioning, cloud-powered remote sensing pipeline for wetland monitoring from scratch. 

To expand your technical knowledge of detecting physical changes on the ground using math, this [Z-Score Change Detection Tutorial](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mGrsZc958PU) is highly relevant as it explains the statistical models used to isolate high-confidence environmental anomalies across different satellite passes.


